506 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I understand enrollment in the plan is optional and will continue to renew each month until canceled\056\nCancel anytime\056 To avoid recurring charges\054 cancel before your next billing cycle through your AT\046T account at att\056com\057myatt\054 call 866\055642\0554170\054 or use the other methods described in the Terms and Conditions\056\nThe plan offers repairs\054 replacements\054 or reimbursement on eligible home tech products\056 Pre\055existing conditions aren\031t covered\056 Coverage starts on day 31\073 Tech support is available on day 1\056\nService fee of up to \04499 \053 tax applies for each approved claim\056\nThe plan is not insurance and doesn\031t cover phones\056  It covers malfunctions\073 and  Accidental Damage from Handling \050\034ADH\035\051 on certain portable products\056 Claim limits are \0442\054000 per claim and \0445\054000 for all claims in a 12\055month period\056\nLimitations and exclusions apply\056 Review the Terms and Conditions\054 which contain arbitration for disputes and a class action waiver\056\nRepairs may use non\055original parts\056 Replacements may be new\054 refurbished\054 or remanufactured of like kind and quality\056\nPlan\055related communications will be sent electronically according to the Electronic Communications Agreement\056)
